":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"This game’s main heroine. Plays basketball and joins the school team. Despises her older brother that only plays eroge at home, and applies minimal/ignore routines to Ryou. Due to her height, she practices basketball everyday and comes home late, but still cooks for herself and Ryou and do all the housework… until all of the sudden another challenger has appeared."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Warum's review"},{"spoiler":true,"text":"After her parents divorce her name changes to Nitta Shiori (新田 栞)"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c458"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公の義妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも部屋で美少女ゲームばかりしている兄を軽蔑し、冷たく当たっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"洗濯機で一緒に下着を洗うのも嫌がるほどのお兄ちゃん嫌い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格は強気で負けず嫌い。世間では美男美女の兄妹で通っているが、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"兄のオタクな本性を知っているため、決して認めようとしない。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"部屋でゲームの妹キャラの抱き枕を抱きながら、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ハァハァしている兄を目撃したりしているうちに、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"男への興味がまったくなくなってしまった。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"背は低めだがスタイルはよく、黙っていれば普通に可愛い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"小さいけれど、バスケット部で毎日練習をがんばっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"実際は、お兄ちゃんにかまってもらいたい寂しがり屋。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8773","sourceWorkId":"13641","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：远野そよぎ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"现实中的妹妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"凉的妹妹，是个美女。对于整天只会在房间里玩美少女游戏的哥哥，她总是满眼轻蔑，冷淡相待。基本上可说是完全“无视”他，就算在家里也很少交谈。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"性格强硬，讨厌输。认为世上应该是帅气哥哥配美女妹妹的才对，可是因为知道哥哥的OTAKU本性，死活不肯承认。看着一味在房间里玩邪恶游戏哥哥，对男孩子的兴趣也基本上灰飞烟灭了。虽然长得不高，还是每天在篮球部努力练习中,在栞线中，意外的是个M。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“就只会一味买和妹妹H的游戏。真让人笑不出来，要是和现实妹妹的话……”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20765"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"82 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8773","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"148 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8773","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8773","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8773","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/03/031aab77181a0b9df48846057b0a618b691570745c28a942fce243bacbdae96c.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a1/a120b3132db58fb6d17b5af412b2f1843699cccd513f207fdc920562bc108842.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"岡嶋妙","creatorId":"vndb:s359","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s359","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s359","name":"岡嶋 妙","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:5949:20765:4646:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c459","characterName":"大泉 麻衣","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"20766","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"5949"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8774"],"vndbCharacterId":"c459"},"originalCharacterName":"大泉 麻衣","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"906"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"a"},"bust":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"76"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"156"},"hip":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"79"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"56"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The virtual, ideal, imouto that came out of the 2D world to be with Ryou. Mai is the innocent, sweet, sister that can take care of any housework with ease and yet be naturally clutzy in front of older brother. Has little knowledge in terms of sex which results in interesting curiosity-bound situations. Also has a complex with the size of her breasts. This mysterious bishoujo often makes Ryou question reality... and with good reasons…"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tomato Conspiracy"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c459"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある日突然、主人公の元に現れた理想の妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"熱中していた美少女ゲームに登場していた妹で、"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"いつも優しくしてくれたから恩返しをしたいと三次元の世界に飛び出してきた。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"優しく、世話好きなお兄ちゃん子。ちょっぴり甘えん坊で、ヤキモチ焼き。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"主人公が抱いていた「こんな妹がいたらよかったのになぁ」という理想の体現。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"本人は自覚していないが、お兄ちゃんには吐血モノの台詞をよく口にする。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"胸があまり大きくないことだけがコンプレックス。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「……お兄ちゃんは、胸の小さな女の子ってキライだよね」と涙の溜まった瞳で上目遣い。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ゲームの中ではわからなかった様々な現実に触れながら、麻衣も変わっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ある意味、現実の妹である栞とは真逆の性格。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8774","sourceWorkId":"13641","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"CV：氷川めぐみ"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"二次元妹妹。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"某一天突然来到凉身边，理想的妹妹。是在凉沉迷其中的美少女游戏中登场的妹妹，因凉总是温柔待她，为了报恩而来到三次元世界(栞的攻略中：舞看到凉和栞后祈求神明想成为他们的力量，于是神明让舞成为了麻衣来到了现实世界)。不管对谁都很温柔，总是笑容满面。喜欢照顾人，也善于料理家务，只是有点爱撒娇、爱粘哥哥，也很容易吃醋，是凉满嘴抱怨“要是真有这样的妹妹的话那就太好啦”的理想妹妹，和栞可说是完全相反的性格。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"虽然本人全然无觉，但却经常暴出一些让凉大喷血的台词来。只是对于自己胸部不大这一点有些自卑。“在游戏中，哥哥不是有蒙住我的眼睛打我屁股吗？”之类游戏中的事，也经常提出来，对此实在让凉头痛不已。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"“那个，其实哥哥在游戏中攻略其他女孩子时，我可是很心痛的……”"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"20766"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"76 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8774","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"156 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8774","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"79 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8774","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"56 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8774","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/20/205d7dfb1aff6743aa6aa794f6c95dbfaa1a5752cf96c32605f8c9aa4d930768.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/91/914c5ba6a6bfb5652f2c5e4c072995fba5c5b09909e4bfadc6971ff3d75ed82b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"氷川めぐみ","creatorId":"vndb:s2285","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2285","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2285","name":"氷川めぐみ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:5949:20766:25055:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_c461","characterName":"妹尾 美紀","sourceIds":{"bangumi":[{"characterId":"26562","match":"exact-normalized-name-in-linked-work","subjectId":"5949"}],"egsCharacterIds":["8775"],"vndbCharacterId":"c461"},"originalCharacterName":"妹尾 美紀","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"confirmed-redirect","metadata":{"birthday":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"1025"},"bloodType":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"b"},"bust":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"86"},"height":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"vndb","value":"162"},"hip":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"85"},"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"},"waist":{"reviewState":"no-conflict","source":"bangumi","value":"58"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Akira’s sister, has a personality that on the ulterior seems shallow and judges men for their looks. However, cares for Shiori alot and considered to be close friends. Miki is bold and knows the otaku subculture well, doesn’t hesitate to use her “moe” to seduce Ryou."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From Tomato Conspiracy"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c461"},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"彰の妹で栞の親友でもある。よくお互いの兄のダメっぷりを一緒に嘆いている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"さばさばとした性格で考え方は男前。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"栞と同じバスケット部に所属し、ふたりで夜遅くまで練習をがんばっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"イケメンが好きで、顔だけはいい兄がいる栞のことをいつも羨ましがっている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「お兄さん、お兄さん。わたしとアバンチュールしません？」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「もちろん、栞には……な・い・しょ・で♪」"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"逆に自分の兄に対しては冷たく、常日頃から消滅してほしいと思っている。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"ただし、お小遣いが欲しい時だけは可愛くおねだりし、お金をむしっていく。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「ビッチ予備軍だよ、あいつは」とは兄の評価。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"なんだかんだでお兄ちゃん思いなのは、栞と変わらない。"}],"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8775","sourceWorkId":"13641","spoiler":false},{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"妹妹的好友"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"三围：B86/ W58/ H85"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"彰的妹妹，也是栞的好友。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"为人爽快，作风也是男孩子气十足。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"经常和栞一起感叹各自不像样的哥哥。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"栞所属的篮球部的经理，两人都很积极地参加社团活动，经常忙到很晚。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"喜欢帅哥，也因此很羡慕栞有那样一个哥哥，对自己的哥哥却很冷淡，每天都想让他人间蒸发掉。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"然而，只有在要零花钱的时候才会摆出可爱模样来，硬是把钱都诈光。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"被涼如此评价，「那家伙可是好妹子预备军哦」。"},{"spoiler":false,"text":"「栞的哥哥还算不错的啦，长得挺帅气的呀～」"}],"source":"bangumi","sourceCharacterId":"26562"}],"profileFacts":[{"label":"胸围（本版本）","value":"86 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8775","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"身高（本版本）","value":"162 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8775","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"臀围（本版本）","value":"85 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8775","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true},{"label":"腰围（本版本）","value":"58 cm","valueContext":null,"source":"egs","sourceCharacterId":"8775","sourceWorkId":"13641","sourceField":null,"scoped":true}],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/05/0568de9dad86520c5af7b6da396b02ddde9be140e6cb540ee2b56f04cd6571d2.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/10/10b21490ed39ef1b1dac2b19076410db555892391020615e63f110803a1f1f8b.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"許綾香","creatorId":"vndb:s2150","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s2150","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s2150","name":"許 綾香","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"auto-confirmed","relationId":"bangumi:character-voice:5949:26562:7801:1","source":"bangumi"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c462","characterName":"大泉 涼","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c462"},"originalCharacterName":"大泉 涼","characterNameSource":null,"role":"main","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"This game’s protagonist, brother of Shiori. Has good looks with glasses but is actually a closet otaku. He only plays eroges that has imouto and especially like the one Mai is in. He is a really timid and kind oniichan that tries hard to restore the family but if Shiori avoids him he wont give chase. He tries to carry everything by himself. He is also pretty good at sports and study, and has taught Shiori about basketball when they were small."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"Based on Warum's review"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c462"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataC